            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Two cards are drawn from a standard deck of 52 cards, with replacement. What is the probability that the two cards satisfy the following?",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 2,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p24-q10-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": {
          "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
          "version": 1,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "p24-q10-a-prompt",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "fontSize": null,
              "align": "left",
              "spaceBefore": 0,
              "spaceAfter": 2,
              "lineHeight": 1.4,
              "indent": 0,
              "inlines": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Have the same colour.",
                  "marks": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{1}{2}$",
          "worked": "There are 26 red cards and 26 black cards. With replacement, the second-draw probabilities are unchanged.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{same colour})&=P(RR)+P(BB)\\\\P(\\text{same colour})&=\\frac{26}{52}\\times\\frac{26}{52}+\\frac{26}{52}\\times\\frac{26}{52}\\\\P(\\text{same colour})&=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 62
      },
      {
        "id": "p24-q10-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": {
          "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
          "version": 1,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "p24-q10-b-prompt",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "fontSize": null,
              "align": "left",
              "spaceBefore": 0,
              "spaceAfter": 2,
              "lineHeight": 1.4,
              "indent": 0,
              "inlines": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Have the same suit.",
                  "marks": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{1}{4}$",
          "worked": "Each suit contains 13 cards. The four same-suit cases have equal probabilities.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{same suit})&=4\\times\\frac{13}{52}\\times\\frac{13}{52}\\\\P(\\text{same suit})&=\\frac{1}{4}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 46
      },
      {
        "id": "p24-q10-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": {
          "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
          "version": 1,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "p24-q10-c-prompt",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "fontSize": null,
              "align": "left",
              "spaceBefore": 0,
              "spaceAfter": 2,
              "lineHeight": 1.4,
              "indent": 0,
              "inlines": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Have the same rank.",
                  "marks": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{1}{13}$",
          "worked": "There are 13 ranks, each containing four cards. Add the 13 equally likely same-rank cases.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}P(\\text{same rank})&=13\\times\\frac{4}{52}\\times\\frac{4}{52}\\\\P(\\text{same rank})&=\\frac{13}{169}\\\\P(\\text{same rank})&=\\frac{1}{13}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 54
      },
      {
        "id": "p24-q10-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": {
          "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
          "version": 1,
